
(7 tokkeessa?) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], dhaabi. }, yoobaate: { Baʼii barreessi: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 cifaa?) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], dhaabi. }, yoobaate: { Baʼii barreessi: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 cifaa?) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['WRONG!']. }, yoobaate: { Baʼii barreessi: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], dhaabi. }.
(6 tokkeessa?) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['WRONG!']. }, yoobaate: { Baʼii barreessi: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], dhaabi. }.
